# Tob Ashford, the Mask — plains T1 basic duelist (bandit)
# The bogeyman of the starting zone: first fight most players will ever see.
# Entered only from plains/tier1/Road Toll.enc, which carries the shakedown
# and the pay-him-off branch. Not in the road pool on its own.

[title Tob Ashford, the Mask]
[image monsters/plains_bandit.png]
[stats hp=12]
[trigger none]

* move Attack
  narration: He closes the gap and cuts at you, fast and low.
  narration: He drives a long knife at your hip, footwork tight.

* move Defend
  narration: He turns his shoulder and lets the long-coat take the line.

* move Recover
  narration: He gives ground a half-step, watching where his crew has settled.

* move Brutal Heavy Slow Attack
  narration: A bolt punches in from the flank as Tob presses the attack.

* move Heavy Power Defend
  narration: He steps back behind the wagon-husk; the crossbowman covers his lane.

* intro
The long knife comes out of the long-coat like it has been waiting there all
morning. Behind him the crossbowman stands up off his knees, unhurried, and
the other two stop pretending. The scratched visor turns to find you.

* win
+give_gold 12
+add_tag killed_tob_ashford
Tob goes down hard and his crew goes the other way over the rise without
looking back. The Pylon visor lies in the dust beside him, scratched and
empty. The Old Survey Road is the Old Survey Road again.

* lose
The bolt finds you somewhere in the cut of his footwork. Tob steps over
to make sure of it. The road is his again, like he said.

* flee
You break for the grain and it takes you in, and the bolt that follows you
does not miss by as much as you would like. Nobody comes after you. Ashford
has no reason to leave a road that pays.
